# P0-SRC — keep the Vercel deployment upload lean: only what `next build`
# and the traced runtime assets need. (.vercelignore REPLACES .gitignore for
# the Vercel CLI upload, so the local secrets files are excluded HERE too.)
# NOTE (differs from the source workspace): mos-build/ is NOT excluded — the
# remote build runs `bun run build:bundle` (vercel.json buildCommand), which
# compiles the repository's own ../src backend through mos-build/entry.ts;
# and the generated mos-bundle/ artifacts are rebuilt before next build, so
# the local generated copies are not uploaded either.
.env
.env.*
.git
node_modules
.next
.vercel
mos-bundle/mos.mjs
mos-bundle/migrations
scripts
*.log
